      "7": "Yes! I knew their split is inevitable, now we are the largest team.",
      "8": "That's unfortunate.",
      "9": "Instead of spending time what you want to do, I'm helping out and contributing to something else: the sooound of silence!",
      "10": "Yeah, but when he has to barf, he knows exactly where to!",
      "11": "Oh my gosh, Firey! You're sooo easy to slap!"
